.121569 .160784 .215686 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 62.8 Tm /F2+0 9.2 Tf 12 TL (The philosophical core here is simple: a public institution must protect basic dignity. When the state controls a) Tj T* (large service system like Railways, justice means more than access; it means safe access. In Philosophy) Tj T* (answers, you can use this issue to illustrate how duties of care become moral duties in a welfare state. One) Tj T* (usable line: \002A just administration is judged not only by efficiency, but by whether it secures the minimum) Tj T* (conditions of dignity for ordinary citizens.\003 Caution: keep the example tied to public service and avoid) Tj T* (overclaiming that the case proves a grand theory by itself.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
